## iOS CSS Tokens & Utilities

Define and use semantic tokens to achieve a native iOS feel.

### Root Tokens
Implement or map these CSS variables at app root:

```css
:root {
  /* Colors */
  --color-tint: #007aff; /* iOS blue */
  --color-label: #111111;
  --color-secondary-label: #6b7280;
  --color-system-bg: #ffffff;
  --color-secondary-bg: #f6f7f8;
  --color-separator: rgba(60,60,67,0.29);

  /* Spacing & Radius */
  --space-1: 4px; --space-2: 8px; --space-3: 12px; --space-4: 16px; --space-6: 24px;
  --radius-card: 12px; --radius-large: 16px; --radius-pill: 999px;

  /* Typography */
  --font-sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Text', 'SF Pro Display', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  --font-size-body: 17px; --font-size-caption: 13px; --font-size-headline: 17px; --font-size-title1: 28px;
  --line-body: 1.45; --line-tight: 1.25;

  /* Elevation */
  --shadow-soft: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}

@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --color-tint: #0a84ff;
    --color-label: #ffffff;
    --color-secondary-label: #9ca3af;
    --color-system-bg: #000000;
    --color-secondary-bg: #111213;
    --color-separator: rgba(84,84,88,0.65);
    --shadow-soft: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
}
```

### Safe Areas
Use safe-area insets on pages and bars:

```css
.Page {
  padding-left: max(var(--space-4), env(safe-area-inset-left));
  padding-right: max(var(--space-4), env(safe-area-inset-right));
  padding-bottom: max(var(--space-4), env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: var(--color-system-bg);
  color: var(--color-label);
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
}

.NavigationBar {
  position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20;
  padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top);
  backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-system-bg) 80%, transparent);
  border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--color-separator);
}

.TabBar {
  position: sticky; bottom: 0; z-index: 20;
  padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom);
  backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-system-bg) 80%, transparent);
  border-top: 0.5px solid var(--color-separator);
}
```

### Utilities
- **Large Title**: 28–34px, heavy, collapses on scroll.
- **Button**:

```css
.ButtonPrimary {
  min-height: 44px; padding: 0 var(--space-4);
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  background: var(--color-tint); color: #fff;
}

.ButtonSecondary {
  min-height: 44px; padding: 0 var(--space-4);
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  color: var(--color-tint); border: 1px solid var(--color-tint);
  background: transparent;
}
```

### Motion
Use gentle spring-like easing:

```css
.ease-ios { transition-timing-function: cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1); }
.duration-fast { transition-duration: 160ms; }
.duration-default { transition-duration: 220ms; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }
}
```

